Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.40,Narration,,0,0,0,,A six-digit odometer\Nhas six number wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:04.90,Narration,,0,0,0,,Each wheel carries into\Nthe next after nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.23,0:00:07.60,Narration,,0,0,0,,At the maximum, all\Nsix wheels show nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.93,0:00:10.23,Narration,,0,0,0,,One more mile carries\Nthrough all six wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.60,0:00:12.23,Narration,,0,0,0,,The display returns to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.56,0:00:14.03,Narration,,0,0,0,,The car did not become new.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.36,0:00:16.40,Narration,,0,0,0,,The counter simply\Nran out of digits.
